(7485274, 1190588, 176377, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all of the votes / comments and for the 3rd place ribbon! I find the content on DP Challenge to be very inspirational and helpful - great website!<br/> <br/>I got this shot after taking some pictures in a park by my house with my family. The sun had just set, giving the moon a yellow glow. I had to dial back my exposure quite a bit to keep from blowing out the bright moon. This resulted in the deep blue sky and silhouette trees / hills in the photo.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you for all of the votes / comments and for the 3rd place ribbon! I find the content on DP Challenge to be very inspirational and helpful - great website! I got this shot after taking some pictures in a park by my house with my family. The sun had just set, giving the moon a yellow glow. I had to dial back my exposure quite a bit to keep from blowing out the bright moon. This resulted in the deep blue sky and silhouette trees / hills in the photo. ', '2016-11-30 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
